{"id":"vod_md_3331","vodId":"3331","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"魔法禁书目录第一季","name_cn":"魔法禁书目录第一季","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230826-1/5babcde0d7d9bc9a35a23979cc46abdc.jpg"},"summary":"自己的阳台栏杆上出现了像被单一样挂在上面的少女，这种非现实的情节出现在了上条当麻的眼前。虽然在这个城市——最先进科学引导的学院都市中，超能力已经可以通过科学技术创造出来，但是眼前这位自称“茵蒂克丝”的少女还是把上条当麻吓了一条。茵蒂克丝自称因拥有十万三千本魔导书而被魔法师追杀，而上条当麻靠自己的超能力也认定了少女的魔法。少女以危险为由离开上条家，上条如往日一般去学校学习，但放学回家，却发现茵蒂克丝倒在血泊之中。在科学与魔术交叉的世界中，上条当麻与茵蒂克丝的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,喜剧,动作,爱情,科幻,动画,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-26 07:44:22","classic":true,"classicRank":5,"franchise":"魔法禁书目录","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/dhdWWxJ2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/6GV88kDZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/OI5ed8en/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/G9X8BBCp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/DdOqego7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/Kzdyth9T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/cm9Jdzad/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/kDCGFiLh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/NyKZzEgV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/vo7f9WWi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/TBoqD4yc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/Wu7bec7W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/RivjWeIQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/QaEqREQ0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230823/ZChMBlsC/index.m3u8"